mcp-server-googleoffice (2.4.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package; fork of taylorwilsdon/google_workspace_mcp 2.4.1
    (upstream base: tag v2.4.1 + 13 commits, b5d4323b, synced 2026-11-11).
  * Install privately under /usr/share/mcp-server-googleoffice with an
    /usr/bin/mcp-server-googleoffice launcher; keep workspace-mcp as a
    compatibility symlink.
  * Read-only mode (WORKSPACE_MCP_READ_ONLY) also drops tools not annotated
    read-only (start_google_auth excepted).
  * Add --version.
  * copy_drive_file sends copyComments only when requested (trixie's
    python3-googleapi 2.166 discovery predates the parameter).
  * mcprack companion package registers the server in read-only mode.

